{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2f11a0ef-041e-8fe8-8e4b-87076d71a472",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T15:31:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Timothy Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:28:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. I've got an old couch I need to get rid of. I wanted to find out how to put it out for pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Couches are bulk items, so they're handled a little differently from your regular trash. What's the address where it would be picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 61 Bacheller Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "61 Bacheller Street, okay. That's in the Fifth Ward. Let me pull up the schedule for that area. Can I get your name too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Timothy Thurston."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Thurston. Bear with me one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. My neighbor told me you have to call ahead. She said, you can't just stick it on the curb, and then I said, well, that's why I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She's right, you shouldn't just leave it out. Bulk items usually need to be set up ahead of time so the crew knows to look for it. Let me see what the next pickup is for your street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. When is the next one? That's really what I need to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:29:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your regular trash day on Bacheller is Monday, so the next one would be this coming Monday, the nineteenth. Let me double check that against the bulk schedule. [pause] Okay, I'm going to put you down for the couch on that Monday pickup. So it's a couch, at 61 Bacheller Street, for Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Monday. Do I put it out the night before or the morning of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The night before is safest, or very early Monday morning. Put it at the curb, not blocking the sidewalk, and keep it dry if you can. If it's soaked through, they sometimes won't take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's been in the garage, so it's dry. Honestly I've been trying to get it out of there for a while. My teenager has finals coming up and is stress eating, so there's chips everywhere, and I need the space to move stuff around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck to them with the finals. So, to repeat it back, couch at the curb Sunday night or early Monday, the nineteenth, and it's dry in the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. Do you need a number in case something comes up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:31:07-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:31:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. Got it. If there's any change, we'll reach out to you at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:31:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Thurston. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T15:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
